  "details": "- CVE-2026-96280: the OCI delta parser read sizes as guint64 and passed them\n  to gsize APIs, and delta_read_data() allocated size + 1 bytes, which wraps\n  to zero for size G_MAXSIZE; sizes are now gsize and clamped to G_MAXSIZE,\n  delta_read_data() rejects size G_MAXSIZE and delta paths longer than\n  PATH_MAX are rejected",
